  «type: X»
  «description: (PLECS) Continuous PID Controller with Anti-Windup Back Calculation»
  «library file: |.subckt Continuous-PID-Controller-Antiwindup-BackCal e u reset\nB1 ep 0 V=Kp*V(e)\nB3 ei 0 V=idt(Ki*V(e)+Kb*V(u,ud),x0,V(Reset))\nB2 ed 0 V=Kf*(Kd*V(e)-idt(V(ed)))\nB4 ud 0 V=V(ep)+V(ed)+V(ei)\nB5 u 0 V=limit(V(ud),up_limit,low_limit)\n.ends Continuous-PID-Controller-Antiwindup-BackCal»
